# Local tests are the PR bar

When this message asks to make sure tests pass, run local `yarn lint`, `yarn format:check`, `yarn type-check`, and `yarn test:ci`. That is the check.

Do not wait on `gh pr checks`. A test that only survives GitHub by sitting for minutes, or by raising Jest’s timeout, is a bad test. Rewrite it so it finishes in the default 5s.
